# Scaffold .gitignore for a HACS custom integration that ships:
#   - a Python integration under custom_components/<domain>/
#   - a Lit 3 + TypeScript Lovelace card built by Rollup
# This is the unified portfolio baseline — verified byte-identical
# across the user's six *-austria repos as of 2026-05-08.
#
# IMPORTANT: review before committing. Loosen only with intention.
#
# Two load-bearing rules:
#   1. `.claude/` ignores any per-integration project-level Claude
#      skill (under .claude/skills/) so it never lands in git.
#      Portfolio-wide rules live in the user-level skill at
#      ~/.claude/skills/austria-portfolio-workflow/. If you ever want
#      to track a specific project-level skill in this repo, override
#      with `!.claude/skills/<name>/` AFTER the .claude/ line — but
#      think twice.
#   2. `package-lock.json` is intentionally NOT here. It MUST stay
#      committed so reproducible card builds work in CI.

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyc
*$py.class
*.so
.Python

# Test / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/

# Build / dist / packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Virtual envs
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version
.HA_VERSION
# uv lockfile — local-dev artifact only. We pin via requirements_test.txt
# (a pip-style requirements file), not uv.lock; CI installs it with
# `uv pip install`. Committing uv.lock would tie all contributors to one
# resolved graph and produce a noisy diff on every dep sync.
uv.lock

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node / JS / TypeScript
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.npm/
*.js.map

# Bundler caches
.rollup.cache/
.vite-cache/
.parcel-cache/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS metadata
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE / editor state
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
.cursor/
.cursorrules.local
.continue/
.windsurf/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI assistants — local state, transcripts, plans, project-level skills
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
# Defensive: re-ignore project-level skills explicitly so they stay
# out of git even if someone later adds a !.claude/<something>
# exception that would un-ignore the parent dir. Portfolio-wide rules
# belong in the user-level austria-portfolio-workflow skill, not here.
.claude/skills/
.claude-cache/
.claude-*
.aider*

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Static analysis tooling
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.fallow/
.fallowrc.json
.fallowrc.jsonc
fallow.toml

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets / credentials — NEVER commit
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets
*.secret
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
auth.json
credentials.json
token.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
tests/fixtures/secrets/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HA local state — logs, config copies
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.storage/
home-assistant.log*
home-assistant_*.log*
*.log
config/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal dev tooling — push/sync scripts targeting a dev box, scratch
# Each contributor wires these up locally; nothing under scripts/ is
# shared via git.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scripts/
dev-push.sh
dev/
test/
target/

# Personal notes / scratch — *.local.md is the convention
CLAUDE.local.md
*.local.md
local_*.py
private_*.py

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev-only test-fixture hook — a local-only Python module some
# integrations use to inject recorded payloads during development.
# MUST NEVER ship. CI's `no-dev-fixture` job (validate.yml) catches
# `git add -f` bypasses. Delete this line (and the matching CI job)
# if your integration does not use the dev-fixture pattern.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
custom_components/*/_dev_fixture.py
